config/local_settings.py
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
service-account*.json
**/credentials
**/credentials.json
client_secret*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The OSM extract (~77 MB) is BUILD-TIME only: road density is precomputed
# into data/static_layers/road_density_by_cell.csv, which IS committed, so a
# deployment never reads the .pbf. See data/local_datasets/osm/README.txt to
# re-download it if you need to rebuild that cache.
#
# The WorldPop rasters and the Natural Earth coastline are NOT excluded --
# static_predictors.py reads them on every prediction (population and
# distance-to-coast are model features), so a deployment that lacks them
# fails at request time with StaticPredictorError. Both are redistributable:
# WorldPop is CC-BY 4.0, Natural Earth is public domain.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/local_datasets/osm/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated at setup time by build_full_grid.py (~88 MB) -- do not commit;
# DEPLOYMENT.md has the one-line command that regenerates it on the server.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/official_grid_ph_full.gpkg

